<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D25-SM9> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-figureSPM.7> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Effective implementation, robustness of relevant institutions, responsiveness and equitability are key properties of governance systems that enable integrated governance (figure SPM.7), while the importance of context-appropriate solutions is acknowledged (established but incomplete) {6.2.3, 6.7.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3, 6.7.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Many policy instruments aimed at preventing the introduction of invasive alien species have been adopted, including multilateral agreements, national laws, multi-level regulations and voluntary codes of conduct (well established) {6.1.2, 6.3.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.1.2, 6.3.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.5>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.1> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "They have jointly contributed to reducing the impacts of invasive alien species on nature, nature’s contributions to people, and good quality of life (established but incomplete) {5.5.1, 6.1.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.5.1, 6.1.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The work under various relevant international organizations, partnerships and multilateral environmental agreements (e.g., the Convention on Biological Diversity, the World Trade Organization, the International Maritime Organization, the International Plant Protection Convention, the World Organisation for Animal Health, the Convention on the Conservation of Migratory Species of Wild Animals and the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora) is not adequately aligned to address the problem posed by invasive alien species (well established) {6.3.1.3, 6.3.1.4}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1.3, 6.3.1.4" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Enhanced coordination and collaboration across international and regional mechanisms are key strategic actions for rapid and transformative progress (established but incomplete) {6.7.2.1} " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.7.2.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "and could help international, national and local agencies that implement policies for the environment, agriculture, aquaculture, fishing, forestry, horticulture, border control, tourism and trade (e.g., in wildlife, but also including online trade in other animals, plants and other organisms), community and regional development (including infrastructure), transportation and health deliver a coherent approach to biological invasions (well established) {6.3.1.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM5> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-3.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Such coordination and collaboration efforts would consider the trade-offs across sectors {6.3.1.1(2), 6.3.1.3}, stakeholders and Indigenous Peoples and local communities {1.5.1}, and the interdependence between invasive alien species and other drivers (established but incomplete) {3.1.1, 3.1.5, 6.2.3.2, 6.7.2.2}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "1.5.1",
        "3.1.1, 3.1.5, 6.2.3.2, 6.7.2.2",
        "6.3.1.1(2), 6.3.1.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D26-SM6> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-1.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Collaborative, multisectoral and transdisciplinary approaches (such as One Health) provide frameworks to prevent and control invasive alien species by strengthening the interconnections between the human, animal, plant and environmental health sectors, including biosecurity (e.g., as outlined in the One Biosecurity framework among others) (established but incomplete) {1.6.7.2, 6.3.1, 6.7.2.2}." ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "1.6.7.2, 6.3.1, 6.7.2.2" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D27-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The national strategies and action plans could be developed or updated to align with and implement the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework, particularly target 6, as well as other relevant international guidelines for sustainable development, through aspirational, ambitious and realistic approaches (well established) {6.1.2, 6.2.3.2, 6.3.2.1, 6.6.3, 6.7.2.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.1.2, 6.2.3.2, 6.3.2.1, 6.6.3, 6.7.2.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D27-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Coordinated efforts to strengthen national regulatory instruments, including for the regulation of online trade {6.3.1.4(3)}, are key to reducing the transport and introduction of invasive alien species (established but incomplete) {6.3.1.1, 6.7.2.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1.1, 6.7.2.1",
        "6.3.1.4(3)" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D27-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-boxSPM.1> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Voluntary codes of conduct (box SPM.1) have limitations but they can be a valuable part of integrated systems to reduce the risk of biological invasions, when in line with relevant international obligations and national legislations (established but incomplete) {6.3.1.4(4)}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1.4(4)" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D27-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Adequately designed and implemented national biodiversity strategies and action plans are instruments to help manage biological invasions and mitigate the impacts of invasive alien species (established but incomplete) {6.1.2, 6.3.3.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.1.2, 6.3.3.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D27-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Implementation of strategies could be accelerated by measuring and monitoring resourcing of actions, implementation processes, outputs and outcomes of policy management (established but incomplete) {table 6.5) (box 6.3, 6.6.3}, " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "table 6.5) (box 6.3, 6.6.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D27-SM5> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "which could also create a conducive policy environment for the utilization of environmentally sound technologies (established but incomplete) {6.3.3.4}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.3.4" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D28-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-tableSPM.2> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "With adequate levels of sustained investment and resources (table SPM.2), including support to developing countries {6.5.7}, specific options that address the gaps and inconsistencies in current policy instruments and coordination can be implemented over appropriate timeframes (established but incomplete) {6.7.2.2, 6.7.2.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.5.7",
        "6.7.2.2, 6.7.2.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D28-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.5> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Regulatory and market-based instruments such as tax relief and subsidization can be used to incentivize action on and investment in prevention and control of invasive alien species (established but incomplete) {6.3.1, 6.5.1, 6.5.2}, " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1, 6.5.1, 6.5.2" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D28-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-boxSPM.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-figureSPM.7> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.5> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "especially when responsibility for the burden of biological invasions, including environmental liability, is shared (figure SPM.7). These instruments may be non-market mechanisms or voluntary codes of conduct (box SPM.1) {6.3.1.4}, transparent and conducive regulatory settings for new technologies {6.3.3.4, 6.7.2.7}, information-sharing {6.6.2, 6.7.3}, product labelling {6.3.1.4} or direct regulatory intervention {6.3.3.1, 6.3.3.3}. Regulations could be enforced with economic penalties and tariffs (established but incomplete) {6.5.1, 6.5.2}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1.4",
        "6.3.3.1, 6.3.3.3",
        "6.3.3.4, 6.7.2.7",
        "6.5.1, 6.5.2",
        "6.6.2, 6.7.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D28-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.5> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "However, taxation incentives, international standards and cost-sharing mechanisms are generally the preferable policy instruments for encouraging entities to participate in prevention and control activities (established but incomplete) {5.6.2.1, 6.5.1, 6.5.2, 6.5.4, 6.5.5, 6.5.6}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.6.2.1, 6.5.1, 6.5.2, 6.5.4, 6.5.5, 6.5.6" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D28-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Efforts to overcome the asymmetries and differences in resource capacity among stakeholders and the potential unequal burden and responsibilities of addressing the causes and impacts of invasive alien species can be embedded in policies (established but incomplete) {6.2.3.3, 6.4.4.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3.3, 6.4.4.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D28-SM5> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Cost-benefit and “willingness to pay” analyses and stakeholder consultation can support the development of national policies to assist in justifying the use of public resources and developing the most appropriate incentives (established but incomplete) {5.2.2.1.i, 6.2.3.1(2), 6.2.3.4}." ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.2.2.1.i, 6.2.3.1(2), 6.2.3.4" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Public understanding of the risks associated with invasive alien species is particularly important for preventing new introductions (well established) {6.2.2(9), 6.4.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.2(9), 6.4.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.4>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Increased understanding of possible biological invasions and the negative impacts of invasive alien species can be achieved through public awareness campaigns {box 6.11, 6.7.2.5}, education across all age groups {6.7.2.4} and citizen science (established but incomplete) {5.4.2.2.a, 6.6.2.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.4.2.2.a, 6.6.2.1",
        "6.7.2.4",
        "box 6.11, 6.7.2.5" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Engagement of the general public via citizen science platforms, awareness campaigns and community-driven eradication campaigns also contributes to establishing shared responsibilities for managing biological invasions (established but incomplete) {6.7.2.5}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.7.2.5" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.4>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Surveillance for detecting invasive alien species through citizen science and social media provides broader security by empowering and engaging the public (established but incomplete) {5.4.2.1.a, 5.4.2.2.a, 6.6.2.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.4.2.1.a, 5.4.2.2.a, 6.6.2.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Communication is an effective tool for inspiring collective action to monitor and control invasive alien species {6.2.3.1(4), 6.2.3.4, 6.4.4.4} by supporting the co-design of management actions, knowledge exchange and enhanced partnerships among stakeholders and researchers (established but incomplete) {6.2.3.3, 6.4.4.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3.1(4), 6.2.3.4, 6.4.4.4",
        "6.2.3.3, 6.4.4.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM5> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "It can also enable alignment of resource managers’ responses with national plans and policy priorities (well established) {6.3.1.3, 6.3.2.1}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.3.1.3, 6.3.2.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D29-SM6> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "An effective communications strategy considers the most appropriate timing, media and channels/interfaces for the target audience (established but incomplete) {box 6.13, 6.6.2.6}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "box 6.13, 6.6.2.6" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D30-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Indigenous Peoples and local communities can be partners in co-developing policies and strategies to address biological invasions while giving consideration to the challenge of conflicting perceptions and values in order to achieve consensus on management actions (established but incomplete) {5.6.1.2, 6.4.3.1 }. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.6.1.2, 6.4.3.1 " .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D30-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Participation of Indigenous Peoples and local communities can be enhanced with sufficient legal, political and financial support (well established) {6.4.3, box 6.16}. " ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.4.3, box 6.16" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D30-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Successful strategies respect the knowledge, priorities and rights of Indigenous Peoples and local communities, including customary governance systems, in accordance with national legislation (established but incomplete) {5.1.3, 5.2.1, 5.6.2, 6.4.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.1.3, 5.2.1, 5.6.2, 6.4.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D30-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-1.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "In cases where the impact of invasive alien species on the quality of life of Indigenous Peoples and local communities is unavoidable, those communities need ongoing support and adequate resources to respond to the challenges of living with invasive alien species (established but incomplete) {1.6.7.2, 6.2.3.2, 6.2.3.5}." ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "1.6.7.2, 6.2.3.2, 6.2.3.5" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.4>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Strengthening existing open information systems can facilitate the management of biological invasions, including prioritization of actions, early detection and rapid response, and can improve the effectiveness of regulations (established but incomplete) {5.4.1, 6.6.2.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.4.1, 6.6.2.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-tableSPM.2> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Open information systems can substantially reduce the costs of management by ensuring targeted and appropriate responses, avoiding duplication of efforts and facilitating the evaluation of the effectiveness of policy instruments using indicators (table SPM.2) (well established) {6.6.2.4, 6.6.2.6, 6.6.3}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.6.2.4, 6.6.2.6, 6.6.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-table SPM.A1> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The “rate of invasive alien species establishment” headline indicator adopted for monitoring progress towards target 6 of the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework provides opportunities to build on existing indicators of biological invasions (table SPM.A1) {6.6.3}. Collaboration and networking among stakeholders and governments can ensure equitable knowledge access (established but incomplete) {6.2.3.3, 6.2.3.4} " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3.3, 6.2.3.4",
        "6.6.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "and improve understanding of the context-specific features of biological invasions. It can also improve the availability of data and knowledge across geographic regions, habitats and taxonomic groups and reduce the wide variation in response capability (established but incomplete) {6.2.3.3, 6.4.1, 6.7.2.6}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3.3, 6.4.1, 6.7.2.6" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Through citizen science, information systems have the potential to engage people, raise awareness and increase the availability of data (established but incomplete) {6.6.2.1}." ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.6.2.1" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D32-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-tableSPM.A1> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-2.7>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-3.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-4.7>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "The available data and knowledge reviewed for this assessment vary across regions, units of analyses, taxonomic groups and time because of language barriers, lack of targeted policies and legislation, lack of resources, uneven research capacity, data accessibility and other factors (table SPM.A1), contributing to gaps in data and knowledge (well established) {2.7, 3.6.1, box 3.12, box 3.13, 4.7.2, 6.6, table 6.10}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "2.7, 3.6.1, box 3.12, box 3.13, 4.7.2, 6.6, table 6.10" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D32-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Nonetheless, filling knowledge and data gaps, particularly at local scales, can bring about important improvements in the cost-effectiveness and success of prevention and management actions (well established) {6.6.1, 6.6.2}. " ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.6.1, 6.6.2" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D32-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-seetableSPM.A1foracomprehensivepresentationofknowledgegaps> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "For example, it would be particularly beneficial to increase the availability of information on invasive alien invertebrates and microorganisms; improve knowledge of the impacts of invasive alien species in parts of Africa, Central Asia and Latin America; gain a better understanding of the role of indirect and interacting drivers; develop management options for invasive microorganisms and marine species; and establish the effectiveness of different policy instruments (established but incomplete) (see table SPM.A1 for a comprehensive presentation of knowledge gaps). " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D32-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Enhancing research capacity in some regions and collaboration between biological invasion experts in the developed and developing world and across knowledge systems could improve data and information availability as well as understanding of the context-specific features of invasive alien species and their impacts (established but incomplete) {6.2.4, 6.6.1.1(3)}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.4, 6.6.1.1(3)" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D32-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.11>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.12>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.14>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.15>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.16>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.17>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.19>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.21>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.4>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.5>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.7>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.8>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.9> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "With political will, strategic long-term commitment and sufficient resources, management of biological invasions is an attainable goal (well established) {boxes 5.2, 5.4, 5.5, 5.6, 5.7, 5.8, 5.9, 5.11, 5.12, 5.14, 5.15, 5.16, 5.17, 5.19, 5.21}." ;
    ipbes:hasWellestablished "Well-established" ;
    dcterms:identifier "boxes 5.2, 5.4, 5.5, 5.6, 5.7, 5.8, 5.9, 5.11, 5.12, 5.14, 5.15, 5.16, 5.17, 5.19, 5.21" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D33-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Mitigating the risks of invasive alien species will contribute to the effective delivery of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development, including the Sustainable Development Goals, especially those addressing the conservation of marine (Goal 14) and terrestrial biodiversity (Goal 15 including, but not restricted to, Target 15.8), food security (Goal 2), sustainable economic growth (Goal 8), sustainable cities (Goal 11), climate change (Goal 13), and good health and well-being (Goal 3) (established but incomplete) {6.7}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.7" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D33-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-3.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "An integrated governance approach that acknowledges the interactions between invasive alien species and other drivers, including climate change, direct exploitation of natural resources, pollution and land- and sea-use, alongside human, animal and plant health, can identify where to best direct policy alignment and mutually supportive efforts (established but incomplete) {3.1.5, 6.2.4, 6.7.2.1, 6.7.2.2, 6.7.2.5}. " ;
    ipbes:hasEstablishedIncomplete "Established_but_incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "3.1.5, 6.2.4, 6.7.2.1, 6.7.2.2, 6.7.2.5" .

